#. module: bf_property_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_portal.field_bf_property_request__portion_type
msgid ""
"Art. 1039 C.c.Q. : l'objet du syndicat est la conservation de l'immeuble et "
"l'entretien des parties communes."
msgstr ""
"Art. 1039 CCQ: the objects of the syndicate are the preservation of the "
"immovable and the maintenance of the common portions."

#. module: bf_property_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_portal.field_bf_property_request__cost_bearer
msgid ""
"Art. 1064 C.c.Q. Lecture affichée, jamais une facture : la répartition se "
"fait au budget."
msgstr ""
"Art. 1064 CCQ. A reading shown on screen, never an invoice: the "
"apportionment is made in the budget."

#. module: bf_property_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_portal.field_bf_property_request__work_type
msgid ""
"Art. 1064 al. 1 et 2 C.c.Q. : sur une partie commune à usage restreint, "
"l'entretien et les réparations courantes ne se répartissent pas comme les "
"réparations majeures."
msgstr ""
"Art. 1064 paras. 1 and 2 CCQ: on a common portion for restricted use, "
"maintenance and ordinary repairs are not apportioned as major repairs are."

#. module: bf_property_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_portal.field_bf_property_document__is_register_item
msgid "Art. 1070 C.c.Q."
msgstr "Art. 1070 CCQ"

#. module: bf_property_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_portal.field_bf_property_document__register_ack
msgid ""
"Art. 1070.1 C.c.Q. : la consultation du registre se fait en présence d'un "
"administrateur, à des heures raisonnables et selon le règlement de "
"l'immeuble, et la copie s'obtient moyennant des frais raisonnables. Publier "
"la pièce au portail donne davantage. Cochez pour l'assumer."
msgstr ""
"Art. 1070.1 CCQ: the register is consulted in the presence of a director, at"
" reasonable hours and according to the by-laws of the immovable, and a copy "
"is obtained on payment of reasonable costs. Publishing the document to the "
"portal gives more. Check to assume it."

#. module: bf_property_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_portal.field_bf_property_document__audience
msgid ""
"Art. 1070.1 C.c.Q. réserve la consultation du registre au copropriétaire. Un"
" locataire figure au registre (art. 1070 al. 1) sans pour autant y avoir "
"accès."
msgstr ""
"Art. 1070.1 CCQ reserves consultation of the register to the co-owner. A "
"lessee appears in the register (art. 1070 para. 1) without thereby having "
"access to it."

